<mxCell id="p7c70" value="⚠️ Mark a node visited when you &lt;b&gt;enqueue&lt;/b&gt; it, not when you dequeue it. Otherwise a node reachable from two parents gets enqueued twice.&lt;br&gt;Use &lt;b&gt;collections.deque&lt;/b&gt;: popleft() is O(1), while list.pop(0) is O(n)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="578" width="820" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
