<mxCell id="p13c22" value="Store &lt;b&gt;indices&lt;/b&gt; on the stack, not values: the answer is written back to result[index].&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Stack invariant: values &lt;b&gt;decrease&lt;/b&gt; from bottom to top. A new value pops every smaller value; for each popped index, the new value is its answer." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="110" width="180" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
