<mxCell id="p15c94" value="⚠️ Marking nodes seen when &lt;b&gt;added&lt;/b&gt; (as here) keeps each node in the frontier once. For a true preorder DFS that matches the recursive version, mark them when &lt;b&gt;popped&lt;/b&gt; instead." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="606" width="820" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
